     }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"activated\\\": [],\\n      \\\"scope\\\": \\\"Unit\\\",\\n      \\\"engineArgumentCount\\\": 0,\\n      \\\"valence\\\": \\\"Positive\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"This model and its unit gain Rending when shooting.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Bounding\\\",\\n      \\\"passive\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"hookID\\\": \\\"Activation_OnActivationStart\\\",\\n          \\\"condition\\\": {\\n            \\\"kind\\\": \\\"always\\\"\\n          },\\n          \\\"effect\\\": {\\n            \\\"kind\\\": \\\"repositionAtActivation\\\",\\n            \\\"distance\\\": {\\n              \\\"kind\\\": \\\"d3\\\"\\n            },\\n            \\\"plusInches\\\": 1\\n          },\\n          \\\"lifetime\\\": \\\"ThisActivation\\\",\\n          \\\"seat\\\": \\\"Actor\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"activated\\\": [],\\n      \\\"scope\\\": \\\"Unit\\\",\\n      \\\"engineArgumentCount\\\": 0,\\n      \\\"valence\\\": \\\"Positive\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"When this unit is activated, it may place all its models anywhere fully within D3\\\\u002B1 inches of their position.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Armor\\\",\\n      \\\"passive\\\": [],\\n      \\\"activated\\\": [],\\n      \\\"scope\\\": \\\"Unit\\\",\\n      \\\"engineArgumentCount\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"valence\\\": \\\"Positive\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Counts as having Defense X\\\\u002B in place of the model\\\\u0027s own Defense stat.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Precision Target\\\",\\n      \\\"passive\\\": [],\\n      \\\"activated\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"triggerHook\\\": \\\"Activation_OnPreAttack\\\",\\n          \\\"cost\\\": {\\n            \\\"kind\\\": \\\"oncePerGame\\\"\\n          },\\n          \\\"targetSelector\\\": {\\n            \\\"rangeInches\\\": 18,\\n            \\\"minCount\\\": 1,\\n            \\\"maxCount\\\": 1,\\n            \\\"targetAffinity\\\": 